  "content": "<lightimg src=\"https://s3-us-west-2.amazonaws.com/codex-content/uploads/images/strife-full.png\" width=\"1568\" height=\"1920\" bg=\"white\"></lightimg>\n\n<div class=\"indents\">\n    <P>\n        \"Not only that, but this instantaneous ruin presents whole new vistas to the imagination. Let me show you what I mean. Suppose you walk to another section while your lover waits for God. <aa href=\"39,152,127\">In this state,</aa> you no longer need to know what you think is important; you don’t need to know how the buildings here came together. And your shoes are too tight.\"\n    </p>\n</div>",
